WEBVTT

00:01:36.430 --> 00:01:37.820
Himeno!

00:01:39.160 --> 00:01:42.720
Himeno! Get out of bed already!

00:01:55.360 --> 00:01:56.960
You're going to break the house!

00:02:01.330 --> 00:02:05.200
Morning, Mom and Dad.

00:02:05.430 --> 00:02:07.220
Well, good morning.

00:02:07.220 --> 00:02:09.370
Go wash your face.

00:02:09.370 --> 00:02:10.590
Okay.

00:02:14.230 --> 00:02:18.070
Hey, Himeno, you're still not done?

00:02:18.070 --> 00:02:18.970
No!

00:02:18.970 --> 00:02:20.520
Just finish up already!

00:02:22.420 --> 00:02:24.860
Dad, aren't you done yet?

00:02:24.860 --> 00:02:26.320
What now?

00:02:27.400 --> 00:02:29.300
Come on!

00:02:29.300 --> 00:02:32.220
I'm... working on a big one right now...

00:02:32.220 --> 00:02:34.500
I don't need commentary!

00:02:34.500 --> 00:02:37.970
You're going to be late.
Why don't you finish up at school?

00:02:37.970 --> 00:02:39.160
I can't!

00:02:39.170 --> 00:02:42.180
Traditional

00:02:39.750 --> 00:02:43.600
Don't schools these days
accommodate all body types?

00:02:42.180 --> 00:02:45.720
Accommodating
All Body Types

00:02:43.600 --> 00:02:45.720
But it's still cramped.

00:02:46.520 --> 00:02:47.270
Tall

00:02:49.020 --> 00:02:52.020
And there's no steppy-step at school.

00:02:49.440 --> 00:02:52.020
Steppy-step

00:02:52.020 --> 00:02:54.030
You don't need that anymore!

00:02:54.030 --> 00:02:56.470
It just doesn't feel right without it!

00:02:57.780 --> 00:02:59.730
I'm going!

00:02:59.730 --> 00:03:01.280
Have a good day!

00:03:01.720 --> 00:03:04.060
Watch out for cars!

00:03:06.050 --> 00:03:11.280
Honestly, she may be bigger,
but she's still a child.

00:03:18.650 --> 00:03:20.730
It's really gotten longer.

00:03:20.730 --> 00:03:21.610
My hair?

00:03:21.610 --> 00:03:22.290
Yeah.

00:03:22.670 --> 00:03:26.800
I've been thinking about getting it cut,
but it's sorta hard.

00:03:26.800 --> 00:03:28.560
You feel like it'd go to waste?

00:03:29.290 --> 00:03:31.800
No, the salon is pricey.

00:03:31.800 --> 00:03:35.130
And I can't bring myself to
ask for another allowance...

00:03:35.440 --> 00:03:40.440
Plus, beauticians never seem too
happy to work on a centaur.

00:03:41.190 --> 00:03:43.700
I guess we're a bit
of a challenge for them.

00:03:44.210 --> 00:03:46.590
Oh, I can see that.

00:03:46.590 --> 00:03:49.390
Especially if the beautician isn't
the same body type as you.

00:03:49.970 --> 00:03:53.460
Trying to comb around my horns
is annoying even for me.

00:03:51.460 --> 00:03:53.670
Specialized Comb

00:03:53.850 --> 00:03:57.630
Well, that's aggravating.
That's their job, isn't it?

00:03:57.630 --> 00:04:01.130
It must be nice to have your
mom cut your hair for you.

00:04:01.450 --> 00:04:05.020
Anyway, you're a girl. You should be a
little more attentive to your looks.

00:04:05.020 --> 00:04:06.840
Oh, who cares?

00:04:07.190 --> 00:04:10.800
Why don't you try growing
your hair long, Nozomi-chan?

00:04:13.250 --> 00:04:16.900
I can't be bothered. Long hair is a hassle.

00:04:16.900 --> 00:04:18.550
I like it better short.

00:04:18.550 --> 00:04:20.810
What're you talking about? Hairstyles?

00:04:20.810 --> 00:04:22.770
Uh, yeah...

00:04:22.770 --> 00:04:24.180
I see.

00:04:24.180 --> 00:04:25.830
All right, then...

00:04:26.510 --> 00:04:30.310
We will now begin the meeting
to decide Hime-chan's new hairstyle!

00:04:30.310 --> 00:04:31.200
Huh?

00:04:31.200 --> 00:04:35.140
Well... I think you should
get it cut short.

00:04:35.140 --> 00:04:36.370
It's easier.

00:04:39.100 --> 00:04:40.370
Well, that's true...

00:04:40.370 --> 00:04:41.540
No way!

00:04:41.790 --> 00:04:44.100
That wouldn't suit our princess at all.

00:04:44.100 --> 00:04:47.960
Hime-chan needs a more gorgeous,
baroque, rococo style.

00:04:48.230 --> 00:04:50.230
She has such strong facial features,

00:04:50.230 --> 00:04:51.630
and she's big in various ways...

00:04:51.900 --> 00:04:54.380
You should actually accentuate
all that more!

00:04:56.460 --> 00:04:57.650
Ringlet curls, huh?

00:04:57.650 --> 00:04:59.940
That'd be tough to maintain.

00:04:59.940 --> 00:05:03.080
Nobles didn't wash their hair, did they?

00:05:03.080 --> 00:05:04.810
And they wore huge wigs.

00:05:05.050 --> 00:05:06.300
Why not?

00:05:06.300 --> 00:05:08.690
You could try cosplaying
while you're at it!

00:05:08.690 --> 00:05:10.700
You pose for that sort
of magazine, don't you?

00:05:11.710 --> 00:05:14.210
Please just forget about the magazine...

00:05:14.210 --> 00:05:17.570
But it might look good if you
just straighten it out, too.

00:05:19.570 --> 00:05:21.330
Oh, yeah, that could work!

00:05:21.330 --> 00:05:24.250
Then you can play it cool
with a standoffish look in your eyes!

00:05:24.250 --> 00:05:25.380
Who the heck is this?

00:05:26.100 --> 00:05:28.930
So what did you have in mind, Hime?

00:05:28.930 --> 00:05:32.590
Well, I was thinking of getting
it cut to shoulder-length.

00:05:32.860 --> 00:05:36.590
It's a hassle when it's long
because I keep stepping on it,

00:05:36.930 --> 00:05:39.840
but I wore it short before,
and people didn't like it.

00:05:37.100 --> 00:05:39.860
In Middle
School

00:05:41.010 --> 00:05:42.900
Really? Who didn't like it?

00:05:42.900 --> 00:05:46.870
W-Well, like...

00:05:46.870 --> 00:05:51.000
Shino-chan, for example.
That's my little cousin.

00:05:51.890 --> 00:05:54.540
What do you think of my new haircut?

00:05:56.220 --> 00:05:59.880
Nee-tan, did you quit being a princess?

00:06:00.490 --> 00:06:04.240
I liked you better as a princess.

00:06:04.500 --> 00:06:05.250
Huh?

00:06:06.320 --> 00:06:07.910
Really?

00:06:07.910 --> 00:06:09.510
Yes, really!

00:06:09.780 --> 00:06:11.570
I get that, though.

00:06:11.570 --> 00:06:12.980
Oh, Class President.

00:06:14.780 --> 00:06:19.060
My younger sisters said
similar things to me, too.

00:06:19.460 --> 00:06:22.060
The class president wouldn't
look bad with short hair...

00:06:24.260 --> 00:06:28.320
Your halo is just hair,
right? Can't you cut it?

00:06:28.600 --> 00:06:32.220
Intentionally cutting a hair halo
constitutes discrimination.

00:06:32.880 --> 00:06:35.850
It's viewed as the rejection
of a specific race.

00:06:36.660 --> 00:06:41.210
Of course, if you're born without
one or have it accidentally cut,

00:06:41.210 --> 00:06:44.840
Certificate of Deficiency

00:06:41.210 --> 00:06:44.840
the hospital or salon will give
you a certificate specifying so,

00:06:45.440 --> 00:06:47.340
but that just makes things difficult.

00:06:47.340 --> 00:06:50.250
Also, it looks dumb while
it's growing back.

00:06:50.840 --> 00:06:53.040
Sounds like a lot of trouble.

00:06:53.040 --> 00:06:54.850
You've got it easier than anyone here.

00:06:55.140 --> 00:06:57.130
We both have it rough!

00:06:57.130 --> 00:06:57.970
True.

00:06:58.410 --> 00:07:01.510
By the way, do you get your tail cut, too?

00:07:01.780 --> 00:07:05.150
It sheds hair on its own when
it reaches a certain length.

00:07:05.150 --> 00:07:07.480
But some people get pretty fancy with them.

00:07:07.840 --> 00:07:10.230
Something you can only do
with a shaggy tail, huh?

00:07:10.520 --> 00:07:12.930
Don't look at it so much!

00:07:12.930 --> 00:07:14.570
Why not?

00:07:20.050 --> 00:07:22.750
Mom put bell peppers in it again.

00:07:22.750 --> 00:07:24.280
What are you, a kid?

00:07:26.220 --> 00:07:30.250
I'm not your dad,
you know. Eat them yourself.

00:07:30.480 --> 00:07:34.180
If you don't,
you'll never grow up mentally.

00:07:34.700 --> 00:07:36.970
My mom told me that, too.

00:07:37.610 --> 00:07:39.130
Still...

00:07:39.780 --> 00:07:42.600
I can't believe that's enough
food for someone your size.

00:07:42.600 --> 00:07:44.090
Y-Yeah...

00:07:44.680 --> 00:07:46.510
You're a light eater, I see.

00:07:46.510 --> 00:07:50.070
What about you, Sassu-Sassu?
Do you eat anything?

00:07:51.050 --> 00:07:54.570
I've made my stomach and intestines
adjust to human society,

00:07:54.570 --> 00:07:56.980
so I can eat most things.

00:07:58.980 --> 00:08:03.120
But my body is designed in such
a way that I can't chew,

00:08:03.410 --> 00:08:05.930
so I can't eat anything I can't swallow.

00:08:05.930 --> 00:08:07.060
Huh...

00:08:07.060 --> 00:08:09.420
Himeno-san, you're not going to eat?

00:08:09.420 --> 00:08:12.760
It's not that... I just...

00:08:12.760 --> 00:08:14.620
You're on a diet, right?

00:08:14.620 --> 00:08:15.850
A diet?

00:08:15.850 --> 00:08:17.830
Um...

00:08:18.190 --> 00:08:19.560
Is that true?

00:08:19.840 --> 00:08:22.850
Oh, a diet, huh?

00:08:23.540 --> 00:08:26.270
Th-That's, um...

00:08:26.650 --> 00:08:27.970
Kimihara-san.

00:08:28.610 --> 00:08:32.210
Students aren't allowed
to bring outside snacks to eat.

00:08:32.980 --> 00:08:35.100
U-Um...

00:08:35.540 --> 00:08:37.740
This is the dessert that
was in my lunch box!

00:08:37.740 --> 00:08:40.340
Those determined eyebrows
won't convince me.

00:08:41.220 --> 00:08:44.480
I won't take it away since
I'm not a teacher,

00:08:44.800 --> 00:08:47.620
but if you're that hungry,
have your mom pack more lunch for you.

00:08:47.620 --> 00:08:49.420
I'm sorry, Tama-chan.

00:08:48.410 --> 00:08:50.050
Sorry, Hime.

00:08:50.050 --> 00:08:51.320
Honestly...

00:08:50.500 --> 00:08:52.880
The class president's like a mom, huh?

00:08:53.230 --> 00:08:56.390
A "mom"? What is that?

00:09:00.440 --> 00:09:02.390
I know you've heard this before,

00:09:02.750 --> 00:09:05.880
but it's rare to see a Japanese
centaur with red hair.

00:09:05.880 --> 00:09:07.140
I know.

00:09:07.540 --> 00:09:10.500
That made middle school
a rough time for me.

00:09:10.500 --> 00:09:13.510
My conduct teacher suspected
that I dyed it,

00:09:13.510 --> 00:09:15.480
and he wouldn't believe me.

00:09:16.070 --> 00:09:18.430
Isn't that discrimination?

00:09:18.430 --> 00:09:21.150
Yeah, he ended up getting arrested.

00:09:21.460 --> 00:09:22.940
Is it because you're half-Japanese?

00:09:22.940 --> 00:09:23.900
No.

00:09:24.230 --> 00:09:27.980
That's just how my mom's family
has looked for generations.

00:09:27.980 --> 00:09:28.910
Huh...

00:09:29.390 --> 00:09:31.660
There's this story...

00:09:31.980 --> 00:09:34.130
A story?

00:09:34.130 --> 00:09:38.180
Sort of a biography...
but it's almost like a legend.

00:09:38.180 --> 00:09:39.800
I would love to hear it.

00:09:41.420 --> 00:09:43.050
Well...

00:09:44.000 --> 00:09:48.670
My ancestor was a princess who was
kidnapped by a southern barbarian,

00:09:49.790 --> 00:09:53.490
and her siblings pursued them
in hopes of saving her.

00:09:54.620 --> 00:09:58.570
They traveled from Southern Europe to Northern
Europe, even to Anatolia, looking for her.

00:09:59.040 --> 00:10:03.550
Eventually, they found their
sister and returned to Japan...

00:10:04.110 --> 00:10:08.960
But from then on, all generations of her
descendants had red-haired babies.

00:10:10.790 --> 00:10:12.840
So it does come from being half-Japanese.

00:10:13.210 --> 00:10:16.740
The raid on the southern barbarians
is a pretty famous story.

00:10:16.740 --> 00:10:19.950
Wait, Hime, do you come from
a distinguished family?

00:10:20.250 --> 00:10:24.970
My mom's dad was just an
ordinary businessman, though.

00:10:25.270 --> 00:10:27.470
You don't have historical
documents or anything?

00:10:27.470 --> 00:10:29.020
I'm not sure...

00:10:29.020 --> 00:10:32.120
Our house was built for sale
in a new residential area.

00:10:32.590 --> 00:10:36.730
Well, it's been handed down
pretty widely as a biography.

00:10:36.730 --> 00:10:38.390
That's amazing.

00:10:42.070 --> 00:10:44.110
In search of the kidnapped princess,

00:10:44.730 --> 00:10:47.140
for the sole purpose of bringing her home,

00:10:47.790 --> 00:10:50.590
the raiders launched attacks
all over the continent.

00:10:58.340 --> 00:10:59.660
With a single arrow,

00:11:02.340 --> 00:11:05.400
they sank an entire ship,
or so the story goes.

00:11:07.850 --> 00:11:09.570
That's ridiculous.

00:11:09.570 --> 00:11:11.210
You'd think so, right?

00:11:11.210 --> 00:11:13.550
There are apparently records of it, though.

00:11:13.550 --> 00:11:17.690
Regardless of the truth in it,
it's a fascinating story.

00:11:17.690 --> 00:11:19.060
Even after that...

00:11:20.470 --> 00:11:24.600
The slaves they freed along
the way joined them en masse

00:11:24.600 --> 00:11:26.020
and became a huge army.

00:11:26.820 --> 00:11:30.990
And so they finally achieved their
goal of bringing their sister home.

00:11:33.180 --> 00:11:33.910
And...

00:11:34.380 --> 00:11:37.920
the bloodline of that militant
clan ended with this.

00:11:38.420 --> 00:11:40.820
Eek, scary!

00:11:41.930 --> 00:11:46.930
Is Being Able to Retrace One's Past and
Ancestors A Reason to Be Happy or Unhappy?

00:11:46.930 --> 00:11:50.930
<i>Does Getting a Job Doing What You
Love Really Bring Happiness?</i>

00:11:57.540 --> 00:12:01.110
Hello, this is Mochida of <i>Hell Monthly</i>.

00:12:01.110 --> 00:12:04.610
Hi. Naraku appreciates all that you do.

00:12:06.210 --> 00:12:08.140
Yes. Yes.

00:12:08.940 --> 00:12:13.480
Okay. We'll email it
to you by this evening.

00:12:13.820 --> 00:12:15.490
Thank you again.

00:12:17.730 --> 00:12:20.740
A girl? Was she his secretary?

00:12:21.350 --> 00:12:24.620
You heard. Have it done by 6 PM, Pops.

00:12:25.340 --> 00:12:30.490
Jeez... Not that it matters,
but a girl shouldn't call her dad "Pops."

00:12:30.490 --> 00:12:32.840
Call me "Dad" or "Father" or something.

00:12:32.840 --> 00:12:38.360
Then fulfill your paternal duty and have
the manuscript done by the deadline.

00:12:38.780 --> 00:12:43.860
You might not like it, but it's not
easy keeping two kids fed, you know!

00:12:43.860 --> 00:12:46.930
Especially now, when the whole
industry's profits are...

00:12:46.930 --> 00:12:48.660
Yeah, yeah. Just keep working.

00:12:49.120 --> 00:12:51.620
Hell Monthly
Editing Department

00:12:50.500 --> 00:12:51.610
Sir,

00:12:52.120 --> 00:12:54.440
is Naraku-san really a popular writer?

00:12:54.440 --> 00:12:56.570
Well, fairly, at least.

00:12:56.920 --> 00:12:58.170
A long time ago,

00:12:58.170 --> 00:13:02.590
he drew a lot of attention for an article
he wrote in a radical undercover investigation.

00:13:02.810 --> 00:13:07.740
Since then, every time that incident makes
waves on TV, the writer profits again.

00:13:07.740 --> 00:13:08.880
Oh...

00:13:09.460 --> 00:13:11.200
Why do you ask?

00:13:11.200 --> 00:13:15.160
Well, I called him a moment ago,
and a woman answered.

00:13:15.160 --> 00:13:17.720
I just wondered if he could
afford a secretary.

00:13:17.720 --> 00:13:19.580
That was his daughter.

00:13:19.580 --> 00:13:23.860
Huh? That old— I mean,
Naraku-san is married?

00:13:24.340 --> 00:13:30.110
He wasn't born a chubby old man
from the crotch of a tree, you know.

00:13:30.470 --> 00:13:32.830
His daughter, huh?

00:13:33.650 --> 00:13:36.840
I heard she's a pretty cute, slender girl.

00:13:37.490 --> 00:13:41.460
I believe she's in middle...
no, high school now.

00:13:41.870 --> 00:13:45.000
A cute high school girl! That sounds great!

00:13:45.000 --> 00:13:45.960
What's great about that?

00:13:46.610 --> 00:13:50.200
Since his daughter's started
acting as his secretary,

00:13:50.200 --> 00:13:54.470
he's been meeting his deadlines,
which is great for us, anyway.

00:13:55.940 --> 00:14:01.210
Pops, I fixed the weird word choices and typos.
Go ahead and look it over.

00:14:01.210 --> 00:14:02.320
Got it.

00:14:02.740 --> 00:14:04.930
And I told you not to call me "Pops."

00:14:05.570 --> 00:14:06.640
Anyway,

00:14:06.640 --> 00:14:11.240
why don't you have a comment from
Professor Bibu at Library Paradise University?

00:14:11.460 --> 00:14:13.980
I couldn't get an interview.

00:14:14.920 --> 00:14:17.330
Hey! Who are you—

00:14:20.120 --> 00:14:23.480
Hello, is this Professor Bibu's office?

00:14:23.480 --> 00:14:24.380
Hey, wait!

00:14:24.990 --> 00:14:29.290
Yes. I was deeply impressed
by the professor's writings.

00:14:30.100 --> 00:14:31.370
Really?

00:14:32.050 --> 00:14:34.850
Yes, my senpai attended the seminar.

00:14:35.700 --> 00:14:39.690
Yes, and I was hoping to hear
the professor's opinion.

00:14:42.190 --> 00:14:44.770
Turn right at the next corner, please.

00:14:45.460 --> 00:14:47.890
I see. Okay.

00:14:48.750 --> 00:14:50.870
Thank you very much.

00:14:52.730 --> 00:14:54.700
Here. The professor's comments.

00:14:54.700 --> 00:14:56.370
O-Okay...

00:14:56.540 --> 00:15:00.550
I'll go put on some coffee. Keep it up.

00:15:04.970 --> 00:15:06.750
Is that the class president?

00:15:07.850 --> 00:15:10.140
Why's she dressed like that?

00:15:10.680 --> 00:15:11.780
Is she cosplaying?

00:15:12.410 --> 00:15:14.630
Hey, hurry up with the coffee.

00:15:15.070 --> 00:15:16.120
Yeah, sure.

00:15:16.530 --> 00:15:19.750
What? Something interesting out there?

00:15:19.750 --> 00:15:22.560
Well, I just saw a friend
of mine from school...

00:15:22.990 --> 00:15:24.810
in a priestess outfit...

00:15:24.810 --> 00:15:27.430
going into the crazy neighbor lady's house.

00:15:27.730 --> 00:15:31.330
Is your friend running
a curse removal scam?

00:15:31.330 --> 00:15:34.200
What? Gonna tell me not to hang
out with people like that?

00:15:34.630 --> 00:15:37.400
No, I was going to tell you
to get closer to her.

00:15:37.670 --> 00:15:38.950
I want the story.

00:15:39.770 --> 00:15:43.420
Well, the class president doesn't
seem like that type to me.

00:15:44.810 --> 00:15:47.160
This is the box that's troubling me.

00:15:48.260 --> 00:15:52.750
A medium I spoke to said it's cursed.

00:15:53.100 --> 00:15:56.230
And what did the medium say?

00:15:56.230 --> 00:16:01.530
That the curse was so strong,
there was nothing that could be done.

00:16:01.800 --> 00:16:05.370
That I should leave it in this spot
to contain the vengeful spirit,

00:16:05.370 --> 00:16:08.890
and to light the candles
and make offerings every day.

00:16:09.610 --> 00:16:12.220
But its power still seems
to be trickling out.

00:16:12.220 --> 00:16:14.950
My cat went missing for a while,

00:16:14.950 --> 00:16:17.850
and I hear noises coming from empty rooms.

00:16:17.850 --> 00:16:21.650
And, sometimes, I sense a
presence behind me...

00:16:22.550 --> 00:16:24.450
Sounds like she's imagining things.

00:16:25.160 --> 00:16:26.410
Still...

00:16:27.070 --> 00:16:31.070
Very well. I'll quiet the box
and take it with me.

00:16:36.310 --> 00:16:39.820
Now I'll purify the room
and exorcise any remaining evil.

00:16:40.290 --> 00:16:41.640
Please do.

00:16:42.930 --> 00:16:45.550
May I ask you to step outside?

00:16:45.550 --> 00:16:46.540
Of course.

00:16:54.670 --> 00:16:57.980
Cleanse! Purify!

00:16:58.050 --> 00:17:01.220
Cleanse! Purify!

00:16:58.540 --> 00:17:01.080
<i>I wonder what I should make for dinner...</i>

00:17:04.030 --> 00:17:05.470
All done.

00:17:05.470 --> 00:17:07.370
Thank you so much.

00:17:08.050 --> 00:17:11.530
Now, about the monetary offering...

00:17:11.530 --> 00:17:13.120
Oh, yes, of course.

00:17:14.010 --> 00:17:16.890
Offering

00:17:14.160 --> 00:17:16.890
Please accept this,
along with compensation for the taxi.

00:17:18.600 --> 00:17:21.470
Very well. I'll be back
later to pick it up.

00:17:21.470 --> 00:17:24.190
Thank you so much.

00:17:24.680 --> 00:17:26.680
Yes... Yes.

00:17:27.380 --> 00:17:29.790
We look forward to working
with you next month.

00:17:31.440 --> 00:17:32.690
He said it's okay.

00:17:33.050 --> 00:17:35.780
All right! That's one thing taken care of!

00:17:36.120 --> 00:17:38.850
It's a little early,
but wanna go grab dinner?

00:17:38.850 --> 00:17:40.510
We can't.

00:17:40.810 --> 00:17:43.180
Nii-chan's getting back late,
and he'll eat here.

00:17:43.180 --> 00:17:44.000
Aw...

00:17:44.250 --> 00:17:47.880
It's always "Nii-chan, Nii-chan" with you.
You got a brother complex or what?

00:17:48.160 --> 00:17:49.530
Shut up.

00:17:49.530 --> 00:17:54.620
I'll make dinner. You just wait and be grateful
you get to eat your daughter's cooking.

00:18:01.640 --> 00:18:04.140
Mitama

00:18:08.650 --> 00:18:09.900
Welcome back.

00:18:10.790 --> 00:18:12.790
You're making dinner, Dad?

00:18:12.790 --> 00:18:13.520
Yeah.

00:18:13.860 --> 00:18:16.770
The kids wore themselves out
playing and passed out,

00:18:17.400 --> 00:18:19.660
and it sounded like you'd be home late.

00:18:20.550 --> 00:18:21.290
And the painting?

00:18:22.570 --> 00:18:24.230
Have you made progress with the painting?

00:18:24.820 --> 00:18:26.190
Oh...

00:18:26.540 --> 00:18:29.850
Actually, I seem to be in a bit of a slump.

00:18:38.600 --> 00:18:42.560
I don't know any more about art
than what I've read in textbooks,

00:18:43.470 --> 00:18:46.140
but are you really a painter?

00:18:46.460 --> 00:18:48.570
That's a little painful to hear from you.

00:18:48.970 --> 00:18:51.730
It's not as if my painting
puts food on the table.

00:18:51.730 --> 00:18:52.840
But...

00:18:52.840 --> 00:18:55.310
It's not about whether it puts
food on the table or not.

00:18:55.760 --> 00:18:58.720
You're off work, and the kids are asleep.

00:18:59.050 --> 00:19:02.580
If you're a painter, shouldn't you
be using this time to paint?

00:19:02.910 --> 00:19:04.340
Well...

00:19:04.510 --> 00:19:08.580
A painting isn't something you can just
poke at when you get a spare moment.

00:19:09.160 --> 00:19:12.920
Besides, doesn't it make your life
easier if dinner's already done?

00:19:13.140 --> 00:19:15.220
In Akutagawa's <i>Hell Screen</i>,

00:19:15.220 --> 00:19:18.590
a painter had to paint his own
daughter being burned alive.

00:19:20.690 --> 00:19:24.600
That's a pretty awful thing to do,
as both a painter and a father.

00:19:24.900 --> 00:19:28.150
You'd hate me if I did that to you,
wouldn't you?

00:19:28.710 --> 00:19:31.270
Of course I would, but...

00:19:32.450 --> 00:19:34.730
If you're an artist and painter,

00:19:35.000 --> 00:19:36.780
you should paint despite
the hate it earns you.

00:19:39.390 --> 00:19:43.430
Even in spare moments, even if your
daughter hates you, you should paint.

00:19:44.540 --> 00:19:47.510
If you won't paint,
then choose a different path.

00:19:48.820 --> 00:19:50.210
Do you want to be an artist,

00:19:50.610 --> 00:19:54.130
or a good father?

00:19:58.210 --> 00:20:03.470
I don't think it's impossible
to be both of those things.

00:20:03.820 --> 00:20:07.850
Do you have the talent
necessary to manage both?

00:20:08.820 --> 00:20:10.070
Well...

00:20:11.580 --> 00:20:13.610
You won't establish yourself as a painter,

00:20:14.010 --> 00:20:17.500
but as a father, you only work half
of the week as a contractor.

00:20:17.850 --> 00:20:18.720
That just makes you

00:20:19.100 --> 00:20:23.110
a lousy father hoping to earn
compensation for your youngest daughter.

00:20:21.360 --> 00:20:23.860
Oral Medication
Mitama Sue

00:20:28.620 --> 00:20:30.300
Nee-tan...

00:20:30.300 --> 00:20:31.870
Oh, are you awake?

00:20:33.010 --> 00:20:34.360
Nee-nee.

00:20:35.640 --> 00:20:39.120
Well, Dad made dinner for us. Let's eat.

00:20:45.250 --> 00:20:46.970
<i>Now for our next story.</i>

00:20:47.630 --> 00:20:50.810
<i>The results of America's
presidential election are in,</i>

00:20:50.810 --> 00:20:55.170
<i>and the Democratic Communist
candidate, Imecocca, has won...</i>

00:20:50.840 --> 00:20:52.310
She fell asleep.

00:20:52.640 --> 00:20:57.370
If she were Shino-chan's age,
I could easily call this adorable.

00:20:58.130 --> 00:21:01.230
Honestly, she's just a big child.

00:21:01.970 --> 00:21:04.840
Why does she only cozy up to you?

00:21:04.840 --> 00:21:06.890
Because you're a child, too.

00:21:07.620 --> 00:21:10.020
C'mon, give me your spot.

00:21:10.020 --> 00:21:12.010
Ask Himeno about that.

00:21:12.010 --> 00:21:13.370
Aw...

00:21:13.740 --> 00:21:14.750
Later!

00:21:14.750 --> 00:21:15.550
Bye!

00:21:15.550 --> 00:21:16.960
See you tomorrow!

00:21:17.630 --> 00:21:19.070
Sensei!

00:21:20.100 --> 00:21:22.840
Thanks for all you've done for my son.

00:21:23.160 --> 00:21:25.190
Oh, it's nothing.

00:21:25.970 --> 00:21:29.390
You're very good at teaching.

00:21:29.390 --> 00:21:32.710
He's never stuck with any
of his other lessons.

00:21:33.090 --> 00:21:36.160
This is the only one he attends
without ever missing a session.

00:21:36.160 --> 00:21:37.210
Oh...

00:21:37.210 --> 00:21:39.430
We'll see you next time.

00:21:39.430 --> 00:21:40.730
Bye, Sensei.

00:21:46.520 --> 00:21:50.220
This makes it so hard
to decide on my future path...

00:21:55.310 --> 00:21:56.680
I see.

00:21:57.420 --> 00:21:59.240
How very interesting.

00:23:31.970 --> 00:23:35.970
Next Time

00:23:31.970 --> 00:23:35.970
First Experiences Are Scary and Fun
All in One... Pardon the Rhyme.

00:23:31.970 --> 00:23:35.970
Occult Movies You Watch
as a Kid Are 140% Scarier.
